trolled trial</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>2004</year><volume>292</volume><fpage>2227</fpage><lpage>36</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15536109</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ball</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name><name><surname>Hall</surname><given-names>AS</given-names></name><name><surname>Mackintosh</surname><given-names>AF</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Effect of ramipril and morbidity of survivors of acute myocardial infarction with clinical evidence of heart failure</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1993</year><volume>342</volume><fpage>821</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8104270</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Barr</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Lang</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanson</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Effects of adding spironolactone to an angiotensin-converting enzyme inhibitor in chronic congestive heart failure secondary to coronary artery disease</article-title><source>Am J Cardiol</source><year>1995</year><volume>76</volume><fpage>1259</fpage><lpage>65</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7503007</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bell</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name><name><surname>Lukas</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Holdbrook</surname><given-names>FK</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>The effect of carvedilol on mortality risk in heart failure patients with diabetes: results of a meta-analysis</article-title><source>Curr Med Res Opin</source><year>2006</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>287</fpage><lpage>96</lpag